  "body": "Looking for a modern, low-maintenance home in a convenient location? This stylish terrace home in Stanmore Bay offers a practical layout, perfect for first-home buyers, young families or investors.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a welcoming space for everyday living, flowing seamlessly onto the outdoor deck, ideal for relaxing or entertaining friends and family.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights include:\r\n\r\n• 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms plus a guest toilet\r\n• Ground-floor bedroom, ideal for guests or a home office\r\n• Upstairs master bedroom with its own ensuite\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances and ample storage\r\n• Open-plan living and dining with outdoor access\r\n• Easy-care design for low-maintenance living\r\n\r\nLocated in Stanmore Bay, you'll enjoy easy access to Stanmore Bay Village, beautiful local beaches, and the upcoming Penlink connection, bringing even greater convenience to everyday travel.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, downsizing or investing, this is a fantastic opportunity to enjoy modern living in a convenient location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
